{"id":"en_i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family","title":"I Worked While a Thief Watched My Family","titleEn":"I Worked While a Thief Watched My Family","description":"After his wife passed away, Chen Kai shouldered the responsibility of raising his daughter Duoduo and looking after his paralyzed father, all while holding down a demanding job. He brought in Lin Qiaoyun as a nanny, a woman whose gentle manner concealed a cruel streak: she mistreated the elderly man, who could not speak up for himself, and set her sights on the household's money. Duoduo managed to capture the abuse using her phone watch, and once Chen Kai learned what had been happening, he joined forces with the police to bring down the nanny and the accomplice working with her. With justice done, the family was able to settle back into a peaceful life. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Contemporary","Crime","Family Drama","Family Love","Karma Payback"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsorw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsorw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsorw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-worked-while-a-thief-watched-my-family_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sourc